RELATED MODULE CHANGE (not a core patch, #128)
----------------------------------------------
modules/mod-living-gear/src/LivingGear_ClassPerks.cpp - TickMageFire's Living
Bomb spread loop now hops enemy-to-enemy like TickWarlockAffliction's
carrier-based contagion instead of only radiating from the player: carriers =
hostiles with the mage's Living Bomb (searched out to MAGE_FIRE_CONTAGION_RANGE
= 60y), every clean enemy within MAGE_FIRE_SPREAD_RANGE (15y) of any carrier
gets Living Bomb each MAGE_FIRE_TICK_MS tick. Detonation (Fire Blast hook)
untouched.
